Package: posologyr.ext
Type: Package
Title: Event DSL, Tidy Simulation, and MIPD Visualization Extensions for posologyr
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Boyu", "Tan", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "tanboyu@shchildren.com.cn")
Description: Extends posologyr with mrgsolve-like and PKPDsim-like event
    construction, observation point attachment, multi-threaded tidy simulation,
    automated IPRED/PRED MAP trajectory extraction, and multi-panel ggplot2
    MIPD visualization with TDM overlays and target therapeutic windows.
License: AGPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    posologyr,
    rxode2,
    ggplot2,
    parallel,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    patchwork
